BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 714 Tm (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 696 Tm (This procedure describes the standard operating procedure for lysing mammalian cells and extracting total protein for downstream quantification.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 660 Tm (2. Materials) Tj ET
