8 0 obj
<< /Length 557 >>
stream
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 750 Tm (3. Procedure) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 732 Tm (3.1 Pellet the cells at 300 x g for 5 minutes at 4 C.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 714 Tm (3.2 Aspirate the supernatant and resuspend the pellet in 500 uL of ice-cold RIPA buffer containing 1x protease inhibitor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 696 Tm (3.3 Incubate on ice for 15 minutes, vortexing briefly every 5 minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 678 Tm (3.4 Centrifuge at 12,000 x g for 10 minutes at 4 C and transfer the clear supernatant to a fresh tube.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
